VibeOS NOTICE
=============

GNOS DRM/KMS
------------

Portions of the software DRM/KMS implementation in kernel/drm/,
include/vibeos/drm.h, include/vibeos/drm_uapi.h, and the DRM tests in
tests/kernel/ are ported from GNOS:

  https://github.com/Real-GNOS/GNOS
  Copyright (C) 2026 and earlier GNOS project contributors.

The GNOS DRM/KMS sources were originally published under GPL-2.0. The GNOS
original author authorized their use in VibeOS under GPL-3.0-or-later on
2026-11-05, and this project distributes the ported work under
GPL-3.0-or-later.

The port is a rewrite for VibeOS's per-open file model. It does not include
GNOS's singleton devtmpfs bridge.
